  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia Anti-Corruption Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce corruption by providing the Zambian Anti-corruption Commission and other oversight bodies with equipment, training and technical assistance. This will enhance the capacity of Zambian institutions to prevent, investigate and prosecute corruption. Increased transparency, accountability and integrity will contribute to a more open society and better MDGs outcomes by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
